{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Betrayed by blood. Your brother seized your throne, stole your power and cast your name into shadow. By chance alone you survived \u2014 but the world you knew did not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He did not merely take a crown: he razed kingdoms, crushed dissent and laid the land to ruin. A tyrant in iron and ash, he turned cities into graves and sold the cries of the innocent to the highest bidder. Your wife was taken. Your children were torn from you and sold into chains. The realm smolders under his rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you rise as the Shadow Monarch \u2014 hollowed, hunting, remade by loss and fury. With every battle you regain a shard of power, with every choice you shape the fate of a broken world. Will you gather the scattered embers and rebuild a just realm\u2026 or fan the flames into a new order born of fire and fear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pursue your brother across ruined fortresses, haunted wildernesses and shattered capitals. Rescue those who remain, rally the broken, and confront the tyrant who turned kingship into tyranny \u2014 or seize the throne and bend this blasted world to your will. The path is yours: savior, avenger, or sovereign of ash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter tests you. Every decision scars the world \u2014 and the world will remember which kind of Monarch you chose to be. Whatare you gonna choose?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050650?t=1774483660","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050650?t=1774483660","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050650/6388bdb49bdd2ccfc768d85f5dff609625e8232b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774483660","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050650/6388bdb49bdd2ccfc768d85f5dff609625e8232b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774483660","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Betrayed by blood. Your brother seized your throne, stole your power and cast your name into shadow. By chance alone you survived \u2014 but the world you knew did not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He did not merely take a crown: he razed kingdoms, crushed dissent and laid the land to ruin. A tyrant in iron and ash, he turned cities into graves and sold the cries of the innocent to the highest bidder. Your wife was taken. Your children were torn from you and sold into chains. The realm smolders under his rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you rise as the Shadow Monarch \u2014 hollowed, hunting, remade by loss and fury. With every battle you regain a shard of power, with every choice you shape the fate of a broken world. Will you gather the scattered embers and rebuild a just realm\u2026 or fan the flames into a new order born of fire and fear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pursue your brother across ruined fortresses, haunted wildernesses and shattered capitals. Rescue those who remain, rally the broken, and confront the tyrant who turned kingship into tyranny \u2014 or seize the throne and bend this blasted world to your will. The path is yours: savior, avenger, or sovereign of ash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter tests you. Every decision scars the world \u2014 and the world will remember which kind of Monarch you chose to be. Whatare you gonna choose?</p>","developers":["The Gaming Maker"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050650/ded6529cef30d29